title = "Sir Aldric's Epitaph"
text = "SIR ALDRIC OF THE SUN, LAST KNIGHT OF THE ORDER.
He went down to the Vault when the king would not die, and he sealed the king in with the Sun Key, and he came back up grey and cold and did not live the winter. Let no one wake what he sealed. Plain steel did not harm it. Only fire, and faith, and blades with the old magic in them."

